{"schema":1,"revision":94842915,"page":{"pageid":7564223,"title":"雅典娜廣場酒店","displayTitle":"雅典娜廣場酒店","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paris_avenue_montaigne_plaza_athena.1.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Paris_avenue_montaigne_plaza_athena.1.jpg/250px-Paris_avenue_montaigne_plaza_athena.1.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Paris_avenue_montaigne_plaza_athena.1.jpg/500px-Paris_avenue_montaigne_plaza_athena.1.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4500\" data-file-height=\"3600\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173172\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-size:small}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:2em;margin-bottom:0.8em;margin-top:0.8em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small{display:none}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\"><span class=\"noviewer hatnote-notice-img\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%B6%88%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89\" title=\"Wikipedia:消歧義\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/40px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/60px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"220\" data-file-height=\"168\" /></a></span>此條目介紹的是法國的酒店。關於英國的酒店，請見「<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%85%E5%85%B8%E5%A8%9C%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97\" title=\"雅典娜酒店\">雅典娜酒店</a></b>」。關於羅馬尼亞的酒店，請見「<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B8%83%E5%8A%A0%E5%8B%92%E6%96%AF%E7%89%B9%E9%9B%85%E5%85%B8%E5%A8%9C%E5%AE%AB%E6%B4%B2%E9%99%85%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97\" title=\"布加勒斯特雅典娜宮洲際酒店\">布加勒斯特雅典娜宮洲際酒店</a></b>」。</div>\n<p><b>雅典娜廣場酒店</b>（Hotel Plaza Athénée）是一座<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B1%B6%E8%90%8A\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"汶萊\">汶萊</a>在<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"法國\">法國</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%B4%E9%BB%8E\" title=\"巴黎\">巴黎</a>所有的高檔酒店<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-fivestaralliance&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-fivestaralliance-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-designrulz&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-designrulz-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。這座酒店位於<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%B4%E9%BB%8E%E7%AC%AC8%E5%8C%BA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"巴黎第8區\">巴黎第8區</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%92%99%E7%94%B0%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%97\" title=\"蒙田大街\">蒙田大街</a>25號。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考資料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%9B%85%E5%85%B8%E5%A8%9C%E5%BB%A3%E5%A0%B4%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style dat